     fields need IsoRim Api 31 and come in through Patches/IsoRimGate_MT.xml. Mechanoid colours from their art (cream frames, beige
     plating, red sensor eye lit without power). Mass driver and heavy charge annihilator: Gravship; charge battery and inferno
     artillery: Chapter 2 (MayRequire). -->
<Defs>
